		{"id":"todo","type":"text","text":"# TODO — channels, in order\n\n- [ ] **1 · meta-ads** — in progress\n- [ ] 2 · tiktok-ads\n- [ ] 3 · tiktok-organic\n- [ ] 4 · instagram-organic\n- [ ] 5 · influencers\n\nOne at a time. A channel is ticked when it has a repeatable winner — that is what opens the next one.","x":-40,"y":-360,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c1","type":"file","file":"process/meta-ads/README.md","x":-40,"y":0,"width":520,"height":260,"color":"4"},
