		{"id":"focus","type":"text","text":"**Only meta-ads is being worked.**\n\nThe other four are folders with a README stub and nothing else — no steps, no TODOs, no half-written strategy. A channel nobody is working collects stale notes, and stale notes get believed.","x":560,"y":0,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"shape","type":"text","text":"**To open a channel:** copy the shape of `meta-ads/` — a `README.md` with the loop and the gates, one canvas seen from above, and one `NN Step Name/` folder per tile holding its documentation, its `NN TODO.md` and whatever it produces.\n\nSteps and numbering are per channel. Do not reuse Meta's nine steps unquestioned — TikTok's creative loop is faster, and an influencer brief is a different job from a media buy.","x":560,"y":320,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"loop","type":"text","text":"**It is a queue, not a ladder.** Creator footage from 5 and organic winners from 3–4 come back as paid creative in 1. Nothing here is finished and closed.","x":560,"y":1280,"width":460,"height":260,"color":"6"}
	],
